## 1. Mission

Globally-rooted multi-tradition claim validation + substance discovery service. **Peer-traditions framing — no Western-primary hierarchy.** Each tradition uses its own evidence-quality rules. Convergence between independent traditions is the core signal for substance discovery.

The discovery endpoint is the dossier-pipeline value-add for the longevity-protocol family — without it this is a lookup tool.

