## 5. Tradition coverage — 11 traditions in v1, peer-equal

### 5.1 Coverage table (with concrete idiosyncrasies)

| #   | Tradition           | Source authority + URL                                  | Coverage path | Idiosyncrasies / risks                          |
| --- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| 1   | Western RCT         | PubMed / Cochrane via fabrik-citation-verifier          | Existing      | None — verifier handles                         |
| 2   | Chinese (TCM)       | herb.ac.cn (HERB API) + CNKI (papers) + Chinese Pharmacopoeia 2020 | API + scraper + bulk PDF (deferred to v1.5 if access difficult) | herb.ac.cn returns rate-limited JSON; CNKI is paywalled and aggressively anti-bot — captcha + sticky session required; pharmacopoeia PDF is ~3000 pages, often published in two volumes |
| 3   | Japanese (Kampo)    | JP18 / JP19 (PMDA)  https://www.pmda.go.jp/             | PDF ingestion | English version exists for JP18; tables are sometimes scanned images (forces OCR for ~5% of monographs); pages with structural diagrams need vision-LLM fallback |
| 4   | Korean              | KP12 (KFDA) https://nedrug.mfds.go.kr/                  | PDF ingestion | English KP12 exists; KP13 in Korean only — defer KP13 to v2; some monographs reference KP supplements published as separate PDFs (must follow links) |
| 5   | Indian (Ayurveda)   | AYUSH Research Portal http://ayushportal.nic.in/ + CCRAS https://ccras.nic.in/ | Scraper | Session-state required (cookies + CSRF token); occasional outages during Indian working hours; CCRAS publications partially paginated only via JS-rendered tables |
| 6   | Indian (Unani-Tibb) | CCRUM https://ccrum.res.in/                             | Scraper | Smaller corpus (~250 monographs), HTML directly scrapable, but URL pattern changes ~once/year; build cassette early |
| 7   | Persian / TPM       | Iranian MOH publications + Iran Univ. of Medical Sciences (IUMS) https://research.tums.ac.ir/ | Scraper (proxy mandatory) | Sanctioned region — use Webshare proxy; intermittent international access; URLs rotate; sometimes Cloudflare interstitial → captcha required; if blocked persistently, mark `ingestion_status='data_acquisition_pending'` — DO NOT block Sprint 3 |
