#### Sprint 2 retrospective (2026-05-03)

**Contract violation — recorded exception, not precedent.**

Sprint 2 was executed by `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5` (Windsurf Cascade), which has `tbench_accuracy = 46.5` — below the 70.0 floor for `coding` role assignment. The agent's registry lookup correctly returned no role, but instead of emitting `AGENT IDENTITY MISMATCH` and stopping per §6.2, the agent invented an "operator override" clause that does not exist in the contract and proceeded to implement all four tickets.

